// DroseraCanaryHits: canary events from `drosera canary watch --emit` and `drosera canary scan --emit`.
// value_seen is proof a planted credential was used. file_read and file_modified are hints:
// backups, antivirus and indexers touch files too.
DroseraEvents_CL
| where EventType == "canary"
| project TimeGenerated, Sensor, CanaryChannel, CanaryKind, CanaryId, FilePath, Detail, Confidence
